    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46586" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sum-mūto</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">subm-</span></b> ), āre, v.
		a., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to
			change</i>, <i>interchange</i>, <i>substitute</i> one thing for another: hanc <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπαλλαγὴν</span> rhetores, quia quasi
			summutantur verba pro verbis, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετωνυμίαν</span> grammatici vocant, quod nomina transferuntur,
				<i><span class="en">Cic.
				Or. 27, 93</span></i>.</div>
